Reboot after the change is made.</value></data>
  <data name="chkFilter_high_resolution_characteristics.ToolTip" xml:space="preserve"><value>Generates additional data (x8) for the filter item to enhance the display of filter characteristics.
Enabling this option will slightly increase processing time for filter Size/Window changes and alter
the appearance of the filter passband display.</value></data>
  <data name="richTextBox1.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>Begin with all spinners set equal to their labelled value.
For each spinner, from minimum to maximum, adjust the output power
such that your CALIBRATED EXTERNAL METER is equal to the spinner
value.  Record the values appearing in the Thetis 'Fwd Pwr' meter.
After completing measurements for all spinners, enter your
recorded values into the respective spinners.  DO NOT USE
POWER EXCEEDING THE RATING OF YOUR RADIO!
</value></data>
