Zero:  Go to zero amplitude during the impulse(s)
Sample &amp; Hold:  Sample beginning signal amplitude and hold during impulse(s)
Mean-Hold:  Hold during impulse(s) at mean of beginning and ending signal values
Hold &amp; Sample:  Hold ending signal value throughout the impulse(s)
Linear Interpolate:  Linearly interpolate output value across the impulse(s)</value></data>
