buzxsYsFKwAHj5fAC6Qphu9tstV5AAAAAElFTkSuQmCC</value></data><data name="lblDiscordNotesText.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>Enabling this will allow you to use the Discord button box to let others know your activity.
You will also be able to use %discord_general% and %discord_bot% to view the activity in
textoverlay and ledindicitaor meter items. You can use %discord_general=N% and
%discord_bot=N% to view the history, where 0 is newest, 1 is the previous etc.

You do not need to be a member of discord to use this functionality but there are lots
of us there and you can interact with many channels and actively view the
#thetis-bot channel to see what is going on.</value></data>
